graph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"F: It''s ok, thank you for helping me, now here''s a token."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"_________________________________________________________________________________"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren the Dwarf: Dialogue"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: Well now what do we have here, a couple of punks. What do you want?"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: I like this guy Harper. He reminds me of me."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Harper: Sorry for bothering you."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: First a giant tree attacks me, now a dumb otter annoys me."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: Let''s go, Harper. This guy is an angry little elf."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: ELF?! Are you out of your mind!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: If I had my ore I would not be here right now."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Harper: Settle down you two, what happened?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: This giant tree tricked me and stole the last 5 pieces of my ore."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Harper: What can we do to help?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: Get my ore inside the house up the mountain, but watch out for Crusha''s."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: What''s a Crusha? It sounds dumb, like you."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: It''s a big rock, they crush you. Sent me flying last week."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: What''s in it for us?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: I''ve got this wooden doo-dad that I was going to burn."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Harper: That sounds like a deal, don''t worry Ren we will help you."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"—----------------------------------------------------------Second Ren—-------"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: Took you long enough. Did you get my emeralds?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: We got your rubies, not your emeralds."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: Rubies? These are clearly emeralds."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: What, no way, these are rubies!"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: You must be color blind, these are emeralds."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Lyre: You’ve lost it Ren, just give us the token."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ren: Even though you''re blind and dumb, you helped me so here."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"_________________________________________________________________________________"}]}]}','Dragonfirebane','2026-08-03 16:50:18');
